water. Any other element breaks it in two hits While armored, sword hits won't make them flinch. Once the armor breaks, they stagger for a while Water armor is a clear, flowing film of water; fire armor has flames crawling over the shell More rushes to steal Flame Rush: charge","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T09:45:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114031928","verified_at":"2026-10-22T11:21:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4859690-1847286114031701","game_id":"steam-4859690","kind":"announcement","title":"Next Fest: DIMAZE Demo Gameplay Live","summary":"During Steam Next Fest (Oct 20–27), we are streaming DIMAZE demo gameplay right here on the store page. While enemies are casting fireballs, lasers and ice spears, swallow the whole spell circle with your Drain Hole, store the mana, and fire it back. The free demo takes about 15 minutes. MAJAK, the tower warden, waits on floor 3. If it looks fun, please add DIMAZE to your wishlist!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T08:15:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114031701","verified_at":"2026-10-22T11:21:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4859690-1846651706691217","game_id":"steam-4859690","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v0.9.8 – A Living Vortex and a Wind-Clad Rush","summary":"Thank you for playing the DIMAZE demo. We've updated the demo for the start of Steam Next Fest. A shorter demo The demo now runs Floor 1 → Floor 2 → Floor 3, where the boss (Majak) appears. You can reach the boss in a short session The Floor 2 key sits on an altar — take it and enemies swarm in Pots now drop 10x more gold The Drain Hole is alive The vortex now writhes with your arm. When a drained spell struggles, it tugs at your arm and the vortex sways with it The vortex breathes, and swallowe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:49:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691217","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4859690-1846651706686240","game_id":"steam-4859690","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v0.9.7 – Mana, a New Opening, and Floors With Character","summary":"Thank you for playing the DIMAZE demo! Ahead of Steam Next Fest, which starts on October 20, the demo has received a major update. Mana Stolen spells no longer use charges. They now cost Mana, shown on the ring around your Drain Hole button. Drain a magic circle while an enemy is casting to learn that skill. Skills you learn stay with you even after you fall. Draining projectiles and beams fills your Mana. You can drain past your Mana limit, but while you're overflowing, Mana bursts from your bo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T06:51:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706686240","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4859690-1846018067940079","game_id":"steam-4859690","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v0.9.6 – Elemental Ores, the Katana, Objectives, New Scrolls","summary":"Thank you for playing the DIMAZE demo. DIMAZE is taking part in Steam Next Fest, starting October 20. Ahead of the festival, the demo has received a major update. Elemental ores Four kinds of elemental ore now grow along the dungeon walls: Thunder, Flame, Venom and Frost Strike them with a sword to break them. Bare fists work too, but staves and fireballs bounce off Elemental imbuing Breaking an ore imbues you with its element for a while, and your basic attacks with a compatible weapon carry it","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T05:56:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067940079","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4859690-1844751498222098","game_id":"steam-4859690","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v0.9.5 – New Enemy Banja, Flow, and a Dungeon That Branches","summary":"Thank you for playing the DIMAZE demo. Alongside a new enemy, Banja, this update focuses on two things: how it feels while you're swinging, and how it feels while you're lost. New enemy: Banja A new enemy, Banja, has appeared. It parries your magic and sends it right back, so time your spells carefully Defeating it drops Banja's Crystal Face, which now comes in rarities from Common to Legendary. Higher rarities sell for more Flow (combo) Keep your attacks connected and your damage multiplier kee","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-24T16:37:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498222098","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4859690-1844115010489348","game_id":"steam-4859690","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v0.9.4 – Save Improvements & Wishlist","summary":"SavingThe game now saves when you enter a floor or the hubWhen you quit and continue, you'll restart at the entrance of the last floor (or the hub) you entered, with your items, skills, gold, and health as they were at that momentFixed an issue where items and stolen skills could disappear after continuingFixed an issue where your equipped weapon could become unequipped after continuingA confirmation now appears when quitting, letting you know that progress since entering the current floor won't","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-16T14:56:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010489348","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4859690":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:52:03Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:52:02Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4859690":"2026-10-26T14:52:03Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4859690":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:52:02Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:52:02Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:52:02Z"},"5197610":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:52:03Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:52:03Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:52:03Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4859690","app_id":4859690,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:03Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"36c4c63d29f0a469deb80a847dd75cda99eff29fbc0f0d9c607421656ae19a27","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"The instant an enemy starts casting, swallow the spell, magic circle and all. Fire their fireballs and lasers right back at them. The stronger the enemy, the stronger your weapon. Climb an ever-changing tower in this 3D action roguelite.","publishers":[{"name":"tazarosu"}],"developers":[{"name":"tazarosu"},{"name":"ramos"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1801382400,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_month"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"DIMAZE Next Fest Trailer 3","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=17925506